			"color":"#232",
			"widgets_values":[
				"A long shot with a fixed perspective, highly cinematic: in the center front, there is a sealed cardboard box with a prominent red-and-blue Spider-Man logo and character patterns printed on its body. The box first vibrates slightly, then suddenly explodes, with the explosion effect visible, and countless Spider-Man-themed furniture items fly out of the vibrating box - a red-and-black bed, Spider-Man posters, a red-and-black hammock, Spider-Man gaming chairs, a red-and-black bookshelf, Spider-Man figurines, a red-and-black table lamp, character decorative paintings, Spider-Man pillows. These furniture items quickly and precisely assemble themselves in mid-air, gradually forming a complete bedroom filled with a Spider-Man atmosphere. A red-and-blue carpet with a Spider-Man logo naturally drifts down from the air and gently drapes over the bedside, standing out brightly. The scene combines cool and warm tones, with sunlight shining through the window, casting clear light and shadows on the red-and-blue furniture and anime decorations.",
